Description: Otter programming language - otter-net @CHANNEL@
 otter-net is the native implementation of the Otter programming language,
 a language that reads like plain English: one self-contained otter-net
 command that runs Otter 1.0.1 programs with otterPS's output and error
 messages.
 .
 This is an unsigned @CHANNEL@ (@VERSION@), not an Otter release. It
 installs /usr/bin/otter-net only: the otter command (the PowerShell Otter,
 otterPS) is neither installed nor changed.
